00:05.060 --> 00:08.690
Beneath the glass ceiling of the <i>Galerie du Roy</i>,

00:09.060 --> 00:14.730
one can see the thin silhouette of a Japanese girl named Yune.

00:15.480 --> 00:21.160
For now, only a few Parisians know of her arrival...

00:34.250 --> 00:37.710
Ikoku Meiro
no Croisée

00:34.250 --> 00:37.710
The crossing in a foreign maze

00:34.250 --> 00:37.710
Paris. The end of the 19th century.
Beneath the glass ceiling of the Galerie du Roy,
one can see the thin silhouette of a Japanese girl named Yune.
For now, only a few Parisians know of her arrival...

00:34.250 --> 00:37.710
The crossing in a foreign maze

00:37.710 --> 00:43.090
As I open the gate and step out into the street

00:43.720 --> 00:47.770
asa no hikari ga mabushii

00:43.720 --> 00:47.770
朝の光が眩しい

00:43.720 --> 00:47.770
I can see the sun shining brightly

00:50.770 --> 00:55.770
doko kara ka nagareru hanauta ni

00:50.770 --> 00:55.770
どこからか流れる鼻歌に

00:50.770 --> 00:55.770
I can hear humming in the distance

00:56.940 --> 01:00.700
kokoro hazumi tokete yuku

00:56.940 --> 01:00.700
心弾み解けてゆく

00:56.940 --> 01:00.700
It moves me and melts my heart

01:03.910 --> 01:09.370
mabuta tojireba ukabu egao

01:03.910 --> 01:09.370
瞼閉じれば浮かぶ笑顔

01:03.910 --> 01:09.370
I can see that smile when I close my eyes

01:10.540 --> 01:15.960
omoidasu tabi ni namida hitotsu

01:10.540 --> 01:15.960
思い出す度に涙ひとつ

01:10.540 --> 01:15.960
It brings me to tears whenever I remember it

01:16.460 --> 01:19.590
te wo hiroge hashiridase

01:16.460 --> 01:19.590
手を広げ 走りだせ

01:16.460 --> 01:19.590
Spread your arms out and take off

01:19.590 --> 01:22.930
hi no ataru toori wo

01:19.590 --> 01:22.930
陽の当たる 通りを

01:19.590 --> 01:22.930
Down the streets where the lights shine

01:22.930 --> 01:29.470
michiyuku hito ni genki ni aisatsu

01:22.930 --> 01:29.470
道行く人に 元気に挨拶

01:22.930 --> 01:29.470
Cheerfully greet people walking down the city streets

01:29.470 --> 01:36.110
atarashii kimochi de shinkokyuu shitara

01:29.470 --> 01:36.110
新しい 気持ちで深呼吸したら

01:29.470 --> 01:36.110
Take a deep breath to refresh yourself

01:36.110 --> 01:44.610
kono sekai wa hora itsudemo kimi no mono

01:36.110 --> 01:44.610
この世界はほら いつでも 君のもの

01:36.110 --> 01:44.610
And this world will always be yours

01:49.990 --> 02:00.050
Episode 06 :

01:49.990 --> 02:00.050
" Crinoline "

02:06.550 --> 02:07.970
He isn't moving.

02:07.970 --> 02:09.260
Is he alive?

02:09.260 --> 02:10.520
Is he a statue?

02:10.520 --> 02:12.270
Oh! His eyes moved!

02:12.270 --> 02:13.270
No way!

02:13.270 --> 02:15.440
They did!

02:20.070 --> 02:21.480
It was such a hassle.

03:05.610 --> 03:07.610
Who's that lady?

03:07.610 --> 03:08.870
It's her...

03:08.870 --> 03:11.370
Yeah, Lady Alice of the Blanche family.

03:11.370 --> 03:13.080
She looks like a doll.

03:16.250 --> 03:18.250
Did you see that, Edgar?

03:18.250 --> 03:22.880
Yes, your beauty is piercing everyone's hearts.

03:22.880 --> 03:26.380
But that isn't what I want.

03:26.380 --> 03:29.140
You want to pierce Yune-sama's heart, right?

03:29.140 --> 03:34.270
That girl won't even budge at the sight of beautiful dresses or wonderful food.

03:34.270 --> 03:37.770
However, that's also moe!

03:37.770 --> 03:41.020
It just makes me want to take her home even more!

03:41.020 --> 03:44.280
Do you think Yune-san will accept my invitation?

03:44.280 --> 03:46.150
Of course.

03:46.150 --> 03:47.530
Indeed.

03:47.530 --> 03:54.660
Unlike that miserable Claude, I can grant Yune-san anything she desires.

03:54.660 --> 03:58.410
If everything goes well,
I may end up being owed a favor...

03:58.410 --> 04:01.040
That's wonderful, Milady.

04:04.340 --> 04:05.710
We have arrived.

04:09.340 --> 04:10.300
Please, this way.

04:13.350 --> 04:15.310
Let's go!

04:27.900 --> 04:29.070
Claude-sama!

04:29.070 --> 04:30.320
It's dangerous.

04:30.320 --> 04:31.240
I'll do it.

04:31.240 --> 04:34.120
But housekeeping is my job.

04:34.120 --> 04:36.240
I can't let you hurt yourself.

04:36.240 --> 04:38.250
But...

04:39.580 --> 04:40.960
Alice-sama?

04:41.790 --> 04:44.420
What a getup.

04:44.420 --> 04:46.590
What the heck?

04:46.590 --> 04:50.130
What a small entrance!

04:50.130 --> 04:51.970
Why don't you stay out, then.

04:51.970 --> 04:52.840
Alice-sama...

04:54.100 --> 04:55.970
Yune-san!

04:55.970 --> 04:58.220
You're wearing that rag on your head again!

04:58.220 --> 05:00.600
You must have been used by Claude again!

05:00.600 --> 05:02.230
How horrible...

05:02.230 --> 05:03.730
No, it wasn't-

05:03.730 --> 05:06.610
Cute things suit you best, Yune-san!

05:06.610 --> 05:10.990
We have a huge collection of dresses and kimono at home!

05:10.990 --> 05:14.820
Customers won't be able to come in if you stick around with that giant skirt.

05:15.330 --> 05:20.960
Oh? Not many customers come down this tiny little street anyway, right?

05:20.960 --> 05:22.330
You're a nuisance.

05:22.330 --> 05:23.460
Just go home.

05:23.460 --> 05:26.460
I'll only leave once I have Yune-san!

05:26.460 --> 05:27.880
What do you want with Yune?

05:27.880 --> 05:29.590
You don't need to know!

05:31.970 --> 05:34.470
It looks like you two are fighting over a lover.

05:39.220 --> 05:40.730
Um,

05:40.730 --> 05:42.890
Alice-sama, what did you...

05:44.400 --> 05:45.860
Right!

05:45.860 --> 05:47.110
Right, right!

05:47.110 --> 05:49.730
I wanted to take a photograph with you!

05:49.730 --> 05:51.490
A photograph?

05:51.490 --> 05:52.110
Yes!

05:52.110 --> 05:53.860
Let's take one together!

05:53.860 --> 05:56.490
I'm sure it'll be a wonderful memory!

06:16.890 --> 06:18.260
Photographs, eh?

06:18.260 --> 06:19.760
Photographs...

06:20.600 --> 06:24.730
I took photographs in Japan, too.

06:24.730 --> 06:26.730
I took them with my sister.

06:28.110 --> 06:30.110
Oh, is that so?!

06:30.110 --> 06:35.360
Why don't you send a photograph of us to your sister, then?

06:35.360 --> 06:38.450
I'm sure she'd be delighted!

06:38.450 --> 06:40.700
You don't need his permission.

06:48.880 --> 06:50.960
Just do what you want.

06:52.710 --> 06:57.510
Why can't he just tell her to go ahead?

06:57.510 --> 06:59.390
You're so annoying!

07:01.310 --> 07:04.100
But I still have housework to do.

07:07.600 --> 07:10.230
You've done enough for today,

07:10.230 --> 07:11.360
so just go ahead.

07:11.360 --> 07:13.990
I can't!

07:13.990 --> 07:16.610
It seems you've been rejected.

07:16.610 --> 07:22.740
If that's the case, then my maids will do your work for you!

07:22.740 --> 07:24.750
Now, you can-

07:24.750 --> 07:25.660
I can't!

07:26.580 --> 07:28.460
It seems you've been rejected.

07:30.210 --> 07:33.590
I appreciate the offer,

07:33.590 --> 07:38.220
but housework is the only helpful thing I can do.

07:38.220 --> 07:40.850
So, I have to do at least that.

07:41.600 --> 07:44.100
Yune won't stop once she's like this.

07:45.480 --> 07:48.020
I've already experienced that side of her.

07:48.810 --> 07:49.770
I'm sorry.

07:51.020 --> 07:54.820
Well, if that's the case,
I'll just wait until you are finished working.

07:54.820 --> 07:55.780
What?!

07:55.780 --> 07:57.150
What is it?

07:57.150 --> 07:58.030
Geez.

08:02.030 --> 08:04.120
Are you sure you don't need any help?

08:04.120 --> 08:06.500
I imagine you'd be able to finish much more quickly.

08:07.120 --> 08:09.370
This is <i>my</i> job.

08:09.370 --> 08:12.250
Please make yourselves at home.

08:14.380 --> 08:18.720
It seems like a pretty hard job,
but she seems so happy about it...

08:19.260 --> 08:21.050
I just don't understand...

08:25.560 --> 08:28.850
I thought the sun would set before you were finished!

08:28.850 --> 08:29.940
I'm sorry.

08:31.060 --> 08:34.190
I can bear anything if it's for you!

08:34.190 --> 08:35.190
Alice-sama...

08:35.190 --> 08:36.320
I know!

08:36.320 --> 08:38.900
I'll show you some photographs that I took before!

08:39.490 --> 08:40.360
Alice-sama?

08:40.360 --> 08:41.860
Hurry, hurry!

08:45.910 --> 08:47.250
It's pretty.

08:56.210 --> 08:58.510
These are unusual photographs.

08:59.380 --> 09:01.010
Aren't they interesting?

09:01.010 --> 09:04.970
It's called a <i>carte de visite</i>, and it's used like a business card.

09:10.230 --> 09:13.600
They're very different from Japanese photographs.

09:17.190 --> 09:21.570
You know that you have to stay still when you're taking a photograph, right?

09:21.570 --> 09:24.070
I just can't stand that.

09:24.070 --> 09:27.290
On the other hand, Camille was a very good girl, so...

09:27.290 --> 09:27.950
See?

09:27.950 --> 09:30.450
There are lots of good photographs!

09:33.170 --> 09:35.420
This is...

09:35.420 --> 09:38.170
Oh my, how adorable!

09:38.170 --> 09:41.010
She's tiny, but she's wearing a <i>crinoline</i>!

09:41.760 --> 09:43.130
A <i>crinoline</i>?

09:46.010 --> 09:49.770
It's a type of undergarment that you use to hold up a skirt.

09:50.270 --> 09:54.270
I used to hate the <i>crinoline</i> because it was uncomfortable,

09:54.270 --> 09:58.110
but Camille was already a mature lady by that age.

10:10.540 --> 10:13.120
You don't have any urgent work.

10:14.120 --> 10:16.500
You aren't good at hiding your feelings.

10:16.500 --> 10:18.500
They're pretty obvious when you're working.

10:18.500 --> 10:20.760
She didn't have to take a photograph.

10:20.760 --> 10:23.380
I don't like photographs.

10:23.380 --> 10:28.010
The camera is taking away the painters' jobs.

10:28.010 --> 10:29.510
Painters?

10:29.510 --> 10:31.770
Do you have a friend who's a painter?

10:32.850 --> 10:36.980
Painters only work for rich people,

10:36.980 --> 10:38.610
and it has nothing to do with me,

10:38.610 --> 10:45.990
but watching them being controlled by rich people while they try to preserve their legacy is just...

10:45.990 --> 10:48.620
It reminds me of the <i>Galerie</i>.

10:48.620 --> 10:52.040
Aren't you just worried about Yune,
and not the photograph?

10:52.040 --> 10:53.040
Wh-What?!

10:53.040 --> 10:59.090
You're worried that Yune will go to the Blanche family to wear ornate dresses and take photographs,

10:59.090 --> 11:04.050
and her values will eventually be changed. Right?

11:05.050 --> 11:08.590
If you're that worried, just follow her as her toy.

11:08.590 --> 11:11.600
I told Yune to be free.

11:11.600 --> 11:13.560
How does that lead to...

11:15.230 --> 11:17.350
Well, just do what you want.

11:23.780 --> 11:24.780
Geez...

11:35.290 --> 11:36.290
Pink?

11:36.290 --> 11:37.210
Blue?

11:37.210 --> 11:39.500
Which kimono do you like?

11:40.420 --> 11:44.260
I want you to wear everything in my collection!

11:45.460 --> 11:46.050
Um-

11:46.510 --> 11:49.590
It's fine, I can put it on by myself.

11:49.590 --> 11:52.470
Don't hesitate, Yune-san!

11:52.470 --> 11:53.850
Alice-chan.

11:54.350 --> 11:55.640
Onee-sama!

11:57.980 --> 12:02.270
Isn't it better for you to watch and learn her ways,

12:02.270 --> 12:04.440
rather than force her to do things?

12:04.440 --> 12:06.860
You're right, Onee-sama!

12:06.860 --> 12:08.820
All of you, please step back.

12:20.500 --> 12:21.420
Go ahead.

12:22.920 --> 12:23.790
Okay.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.890
Um, I'm finished.

12:37.890 --> 12:39.480
Amazing!

12:39.480 --> 12:41.900
It was just a giant cloth,

12:41.900 --> 12:44.320
but now it's completely changed!

12:44.320 --> 12:47.650
How can you make this work with just knots?!
There are no buttons!

12:47.650 --> 12:50.320
I want to see it again!

12:50.320 --> 12:52.740
Oh, but before that...

12:54.660 --> 12:56.490
U-Uh...

12:56.490 --> 12:57.700
Wonderful!

12:57.700 --> 13:00.660
You should just stay sitting right there!

13:00.660 --> 13:02.920
Next...

13:03.500 --> 13:04.590
Um...

13:05.500 --> 13:06.210
Um...!

13:07.550 --> 13:13.340
If you want, I'll help you put one on next.

13:13.340 --> 13:14.680
Really?

13:14.680 --> 13:16.220
But, I...

13:16.220 --> 13:18.470
usually wear it like this!

13:20.060 --> 13:24.810
Why don't you learn the correct way to wear it, Alice-chan?

13:27.440 --> 13:29.280
You're right, Onee-sama!

13:39.080 --> 13:40.790
What's wrong?

13:40.790 --> 13:43.460
The <i>crinoline</i> looks like a birdcage.

13:43.460 --> 13:44.960
A birdcage?

13:44.960 --> 13:48.210
You're right, I can't wear a kimono with this.

13:49.920 --> 13:52.220
A birdcage... how accurate.

13:58.060 --> 13:59.310
What now?

14:00.060 --> 14:02.810
Your hip...

14:02.810 --> 14:04.600
Should I take off my corset, too?

14:05.100 --> 14:08.400
Yes, or you might need some unnecessary cloth.

14:09.280 --> 14:10.900
Cloth?

14:10.900 --> 14:13.570
Why are you doing such a strange thing?

14:13.570 --> 14:17.910
I'm sorry, but I can't tie the obi unless your abdomen is flat.

14:17.910 --> 14:24.170
We get our strings tightened three times a day just to keep our hips small.

14:24.170 --> 14:27.670
Still, I cheat and loosen them up.

14:27.670 --> 14:31.010
Onee-sama never does such a thing, though!

14:31.010 --> 14:35.130
She has a future, unlike me.

14:36.760 --> 14:41.270
Look at me, Yune-san! Not Onee-sama!

14:41.270 --> 14:42.480
Right!

14:46.100 --> 14:47.020
How is it?

14:48.270 --> 14:50.770
You're very cute, Alice-chan.

14:50.770 --> 14:52.610
Yes, it looks very nice.

14:54.650 --> 14:56.490
Then...

14:56.490 --> 14:59.160
I'll let you wear my dresses!

15:06.370 --> 15:07.960
Oh my!

15:08.460 --> 15:12.050
There's no way Yune-san could wear a corset.

15:12.050 --> 15:15.220
It might be a bit loose, since it's Alice-chan's dress.

15:15.220 --> 15:16.680
It's wonderful!

15:16.680 --> 15:18.050
You're amazing, Yune-san!

15:18.050 --> 15:20.140
How does it feel?

15:20.140 --> 15:20.720
Uh...

15:21.180 --> 15:23.720
My toes feel very strange.

15:23.720 --> 15:30.650
That's right, your toes are never scrunched up like this.

15:30.650 --> 15:34.190
My legs also feel cold.

15:34.190 --> 15:36.070
Your legs feel cold?

15:37.070 --> 15:39.950
The wind must be blowing up from under your skirt.

15:39.950 --> 15:40.700
Yes!

15:42.540 --> 15:43.700
I'm sorry!

15:49.330 --> 15:50.080
I'm sorry!

15:50.080 --> 15:50.960
I'm so-

15:55.090 --> 15:57.840
Just stop moving, Yune-san.

15:57.840 --> 15:59.720
I'm sorry...

15:59.720 --> 16:01.890
My, my.

16:07.180 --> 16:08.690
Wha-

16:08.690 --> 16:12.110
The end of the kimono is clinging onto my leg!

16:13.650 --> 16:16.240
Why can't I walk?!

16:14.480 --> 16:16.240
Are they going to be all right?

16:16.240 --> 16:18.200
Please do your best.

16:24.660 --> 16:26.830
It's hard to get used to.

16:26.830 --> 16:28.290
I was like that at first.

16:28.710 --> 16:30.290
You too, Camille-sama?

16:30.290 --> 16:36.630
When I see you, it seems like you're one with the <i>crinoline</i>!

16:37.050 --> 16:39.590
You're just so elegant!

16:40.970 --> 16:45.140
I can just imagine Onee-sama in high society...

17:08.080 --> 17:11.670
Well? How does it feel to be inside a birdcage?

17:12.420 --> 17:16.210
It gets more comfortable the longer you wear it.

17:17.670 --> 17:21.340
The preperations for the photographs are finished, ladies.

17:21.340 --> 17:22.550
Let us proceed.

17:23.340 --> 17:25.300
Wait, Onee-sama!

17:27.930 --> 17:29.310
Are you all right?

17:29.850 --> 17:33.270
If so, please don't move until the photograph is finished.

17:33.270 --> 17:34.770
Ready?

17:35.480 --> 17:36.770
1...

17:36.770 --> 17:38.150
2...

17:38.150 --> 17:38.980
3...

17:40.110 --> 17:40.990
I'm sorry!

17:41.490 --> 17:44.200
Don't worry, let's take another one.

17:44.200 --> 17:45.490
Ready?

17:45.870 --> 17:47.160
1...

17:47.160 --> 17:48.450
2...

17:48.450 --> 17:49.750
3...

17:49.750 --> 17:51.250
Please stay still...

17:49.750 --> 17:51.250
Gosh!

17:51.250 --> 17:53.710
Please stand still next time.

17:53.710 --> 17:56.210
Anyway, here we go.

17:56.210 --> 17:56.880
Ready?

17:56.880 --> 17:58.090
1...

17:58.090 --> 17:58.630
2...

18:01.970 --> 18:04.390
Please do your best.

18:17.520 --> 18:19.900
Don't move this time!

18:19.900 --> 18:21.320
Don't even blink!

18:21.320 --> 18:21.990
Okay!

18:21.990 --> 18:26.660
This is going to be our memory together!
It has to be a fantastic photograph!

18:26.660 --> 18:28.410
Okay! I'll do my best!

18:31.330 --> 18:32.410
Are they going to be all right?

18:32.410 --> 18:34.580
Please do your best.

18:37.960 --> 18:39.670
Here we go.

18:40.090 --> 18:41.050
1...

18:41.050 --> 18:42.670
2...

18:41.050 --> 18:42.670
Yune-san?

18:42.670 --> 18:44.170
3...

18:44.170 --> 18:45.550
4...

18:45.550 --> 18:46.220
5...

18:51.560 --> 18:53.430
Thank you very much.

19:06.160 --> 19:07.240
I see,

19:10.530 --> 19:16.210
that birdcage may prevent you from reaching toward what you desire.

19:19.460 --> 19:21.710
Camille-sama, Yune-sama,

19:19.460 --> 19:20.960
How long does it take to print?

19:20.960 --> 19:22.090
Is it really fast?

19:21.710 --> 19:25.220
it is getting cold, so please come inside.

19:22.090 --> 19:23.960
No, I need to develop it...

19:23.960 --> 19:26.090
Develop it, then!

19:25.220 --> 19:26.090
I'm on my way.

19:30.220 --> 19:31.100
The cat!

19:46.650 --> 19:47.990
Claude-sama!

19:48.610 --> 19:50.370
What's with that outfit?

19:50.370 --> 19:52.870
Um, I...

19:54.370 --> 19:57.370
It's your fault for wearing that frilly thing.

19:57.370 --> 19:58.290
Yes...

19:59.000 --> 20:01.840
Alice-sama's elder sister was with us, too!

20:03.250 --> 20:05.550
I want to introduce her to you, Claude-sama!

20:06.050 --> 20:07.090
Hey, Yune!

20:12.100 --> 20:14.520
She was just here...

20:16.140 --> 20:19.020
I'll be waiting, so get changed.

20:19.020 --> 20:19.850
Okay.

20:20.480 --> 20:23.020
You didn't have to come pick her up.

20:23.020 --> 20:24.940
I would've sent her back!

20:24.940 --> 20:28.200
What an annoying man.

20:43.380 --> 20:48.510
Is Camille-sama holding something back, Claude-sama?

20:48.510 --> 20:49.510
Why do you think that?

20:49.510 --> 20:51.760
Did Camille say something?

20:51.760 --> 20:56.520
She said that a birdcage could prevent you from reaching towards what you desire.

21:00.140 --> 21:03.980
You really shouldn't go over there too often.

21:14.160 --> 21:18.500
You also shouldn't be wearing that frilly thing.

21:22.460 --> 21:23.380
Let's go.

21:23.380 --> 21:24.080
Okay!

21:37.060 --> 21:43.650
aa marude yume wo miteru you na

21:37.060 --> 21:43.650
ああ、まるで夢を見てるような

21:37.060 --> 21:43.650
Ah, it's as if I'm in a dream

21:43.650 --> 21:49.440
yawarakana hikari no naka de

21:43.650 --> 21:49.440
柔らかな光の中で

21:43.650 --> 21:49.440
As I lie here in this tender light

21:49.440 --> 22:00.450
me wo tojite mimi wo sumasereba kikoete kuru

21:49.440 --> 22:00.450
